  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/v1.13/identity-service-api/#post_matrixidentityv2sign-ed25519\n\n**Issue**\nThe `signatures` field in the response for [/_matrix/identity/v2/sign-ed25519](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.13/identity-service-api/#post_matrixidentityv2sign-ed25519) does not make it clear if it \"my.id.server\" should be a server id or something else. \nIs it supposed to be the same as the `signatures` field in /_matrix/identity/v2/3pid/bind`?\n",
